msgid "Configuring Logging"
msgstr "配置日志"

msgid "This guide explains logging and how to configure it."
msgstr "本指南解释了日志记录以及如何配置它。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Internally, Quarkus uses JBoss Log Manager and the JBoss Logging facade.\n"
"You can use the JBoss Logging facade inside your code as it's already provided,\n"
"or any of the supported Logging API listed in the next chapter as Quarkus will send them to JBoss Log Manager."
msgstr "在内部，Quarkus 使用 JBoss Log Manager 和 JBoss Logging facade。你可以在代码中使用已经提供的 JBoss Logging facade，也可以使用下一章列出的任何受支持的日志 API，因为 Quarkus 会将它们发送到 JBoss Log Manager。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "All the logging configuration will then be done inside your `application.properties`."
msgstr "所有日志配置都将在 `application.properties` 中完成。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Supported Logging APIs"
msgstr "支持的日志 API"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Applications and components may use any of the following APIs for logging, and the logs will be merged:"
msgstr "应用程序和组件可使用以下任何 API 进行日志记录，日志将被合并："

#, fuzzy
msgid "JDK `java.util.logging` (also called JUL)"
msgstr "JDK `java.util.logging` （也称 JUL）"

#, fuzzy
msgid "https://github.com/jboss-logging/jboss-logging[JBoss Logging]"
msgstr "link:https://github.com/jboss-logging/jboss-logging[JBoss 日志]"

#, fuzzy
msgid "https://www.slf4j.org/[SLF4J]"
msgstr "link:https://www.slf4j.org/[SLF4J]"

#, fuzzy
msgid "https://commons.apache.org/proper/commons-logging/[Apache Commons Logging]"
msgstr "link:https://commons.apache.org/proper/commons-logging/[Apache Commons 日志]"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Internally Quarkus uses JBoss Logging; you can also use it inside your application so that no other dependencies should be added for your logs."
msgstr "Quarkus 在内部使用 JBoss Logging；你也可以在应用程序中使用它，这样就无需为日志添加其他依赖项。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Logging with Panache"
msgstr "潇洒写意的日志"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Instead of declaring a `Logger` field, you can use the simplified logging API:"
msgstr "您可以使用简化的日志 API 来代替声明 `Logger` 字段："

#, fuzzy
msgid "The `io.quarkus.logging.Log` class mirrors the JBoss Logging API, except all methods are `static`."
msgstr "`io.quarkus.logging.Log` 类与 JBoss Logging API 类似，只是所有方法都是 `static` 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Note that the class doesn't declare a logger field.\n"
"This is because during application build, a `private static final org.jboss.logging.Logger` field is created automatically, in each class that uses the `Log` API.\n"
"The fully qualified name of the class that calls the `Log` methods is used as a logger name.\n"
"In this example, the logger name would be `com.example.MyService`."
msgstr "请注意，该类没有声明日志记录器字段。这是因为在应用程序构建过程中，每个使用 `Log` API 的类都会自动创建一个 `private static final org.jboss.logging.Logger` 字段。调用 `Log` 方法的类的完整限定名称被用作日志记录器名称。在本例中，日志记录器名称为 `com.example.MyService` 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Finally, during application build, all calls to `Log` methods are rewritten to regular JBoss Logging calls on the logger field."
msgstr "最后，在应用程序构建过程中，所有对 `Log` 方法的调用都会在日志记录器字段上重写为常规的 JBoss Logging 调用。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Injecting a Logger"
msgstr "注入记录仪"

#, fuzzy
msgid "You can also inject a configured `org.jboss.logging.Logger` instance in your beans and resource classes."
msgstr "您还可以在 Bean 和资源类中注入已配置的 `org.jboss.logging.Logger` 实例。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The FQCN of the declaring class is used as a logger name, i.e. `org.jboss.logging.Logger.getLogger(SimpleBean.class)` will be used."
msgstr "声明类的 FQCN 将用作日志记录器名称，即 `org.jboss.logging.Logger.getLogger(SimpleBean.class)` 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "In this case, the name _foo_ is used as a logger name, i.e. `org.jboss.logging.Logger.getLogger(\"foo\")` will be used."
msgstr "在这种情况下，将使用 _foo_ 作为日志记录器名称，即 `org.jboss.logging.Logger.getLogger(\"foo\")` 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "What about Apache Log4j ?"
msgstr "Apache Log4j 如何？"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"link:https://logging.apache.org/log4j/2.x/[Log4j] is a logging implementation: it contains a logging backend and a logging facade.\n"
"Quarkus uses the JBoss Log Manager backend, so you will need to include the `log4j2-jboss-logmanager` library to route Log4j logs to JBoss Log Manager."
msgstr "link:https://logging.apache.org/log4j/2.x/[Log4j] 是一种日志实现：它包含一个日志后端和一个日志界面。Quarkus 使用 JBoss Log Manager 后端，因此需要包含 `log4j2-jboss-logmanager` 库，以便将 Log4j 日志路由到 JBoss Log Manager。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "This is the library needed for Log4j version 2; if you use the legacy Log4j version 1 you need to use `log4j-jboss-logmanager` instead."
msgstr "这是 Log4j 版本 2 所需的库，如果使用传统的 Log4j 版本 1，则需要使用 `log4j-jboss-logmanager` 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "You can then use the Log4j API inside your application."
msgstr "然后，您就可以在应用程序中使用 Log4j API。"

