msgstr "要将日志级别设置为低于 `DEBUG` ，就必须调整最小日志级别，可以通过 `quarkus.log.min-level` 属性进行全局调整，也可以如上例所示按类别进行调整，还可以调整日志级别本身。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Minimum logging level sets a floor level that Quarkus will be needed to potentially generate,\n"
"opening the door to optimization opportunities.\n"
